Alva Home credits and favicon task

Scope: preserve the existing architecture, dark glass-strip composition,
responsive layouts, accessibility, shared credits data, and gameplay.

Requirements

1. Remove obsolete company/platform wording throughout textual source and
   documentation. Retain Jump Ultimate Stars, The Spriters Resource, Dazz, and
   FRET attribution. Keep the rights disclaimer generic: original third-party
   characters, games, artwork, and related properties belong to their rights
   holders; Alva does not claim ownership.
2. Keep the endless Home credits roll at 22 CSS px/sec in HomeScreen.update(dt),
   using the app's existing frame loop. Preserve the accessibility-hidden copy.
3. Support wheel/trackpad, touch/pointer dragging, and focused keyboard scrolling
   in the credits column only. Pause immediately on interaction and resume from
   the current position after about 2 seconds of inactivity. Wrap movement in
   both directions without a seam. Use one authoritative logical offset.
4. Capture and release pointers cleanly, including cancellation and screen exit.
   Install listeners once; do not add intervals or permanent animation loops.
5. Keep Play as the default focus and preserve keyboard/gamepad menu navigation.
   Keep Help & Credits disabled on Home. Give the credits a labeled focusable
   region; portrait-hidden credits must not intercept taps or keyboard focus.
6. Reduced-motion mode shows one manually scrollable copy, never auto-resumes,
   and responds to preference changes while Home is active.
7. Use the existing root alvafav.PNG as the favicon, with exact case and the
   relative href ./alvafav.PNG and image/png MIME type. Retain project-subpath
   compatibility. Update README.md and ALVA_SPEC.md to describe actual behavior.
8. Preserve the 21-degree glass, green edge, fades, upright text, clipping,
   narrow/short-height layouts, and portrait behavior. Do not alter sprites,
   combat, physics, stages, camera, selection screens, HUD, or splash timing.
   Keep plain HTML/CSS/ES modules; add no dependencies, assets, or build step.

Acceptance checks

- Search all textual repository content for obsolete attribution wording.
- Confirm Home and the Credits tab use the canonical CREDITS definition.
- Confirm the active favicon points to alvafav.PNG with a relative URL.
- Exercise wheel/trackpad, pointer/touch, focused keyboard, repeated inactivity
  resume, forward/backward loop boundaries, and repeated Home visits.
- Verify reduced-motion behavior and live preference changes.
- Verify Play, menu navigation, portrait hit testing, responsive clipping,
  document scroll containment, and the existing game flow; check runtime errors.
- Review the final diff for unrelated changes.
